Hi all,

I have implemented a simple Lotka-Volterra type equation as a function in stan as follows:
-----
functions {
      real[] lv(real t,
                 real[] y,
                 real[] theta,
                 real[] x_r,
                 int[] x_i) {
        real alpha_ab;
        real beta_ab;
        real alpha_na;
        real beta_na;
        real dydt[2];

        alpha_ab<-theta[1];
        beta_ab<-theta[2];
        alpha_na<-theta[3];
        beta_na<-theta[4];

        dydt[1] <- alpha_ab*y[2]-beta_ab*y[1];
        dydt[2] <- y[2]*(alpha_na-beta_na*y[1]);
        return dydt;
} }
----
